  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Dear devs of vrchat,\n\nAs an PROUD Indian man, I find it profoundly disheartening that my mother tongue, Hindi, has been spelt incorrectly in its native Devanagari script in the \"choose language\" sub-menu.\n\nWhile I can understand that the limited abilities of the Anglo-Saxon mind are not suitable to grasp the intricacies of the vastly superior Indo-Aryanic alphasyllabary, \n\nhuman faculty for pattern recognition and the discernment of shapes emerges during the earliest stages of cognitive development, thereby eliminating any justification for such an egregious and inexcusable error.\n\nI demand that you fix this error with the correct spelling (हिन्दी or हिंदी) immediately. attached are the screenshots of this bug. >:(",
